                "description": "Unscaled sketch with arrowed Cartesian axes, no ticks or grid, a horizontal left branch and a rising right half-parabola meeting at a filled point labelled (1,1). Ordinary graph strokes use house black.",
                "mathematics": "y=1 for x<1; y=(x-1)^2+1 for x>=1. The junction (1,1) is included.",
                "answerVisibility": "Answer editions only; the student question supplies no axes or graph."
              },
